<title>POLAND: Polish Bank Handlowy sells PLN 10 mln Ford CPs.</title>
<headline>Polish Bank Handlowy sells PLN 10 mln Ford CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Handlowy SA on Thursday sold 10 million zlotys of commercial paper for Ford Credit Europe plc, a unit of Ford Motor Co., maturing on January 15, 1997, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Ford Credit Europe's paper was sold at an average yield of 18.94 percent and a maximum yield of 19.27 percent.</p>
<p>The offering was a part of Ford's 200-million-zloty borrowing programme.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
